  <item>
    <title>NO.46 香芋维也纳加点冷空气</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae3f71dc96c8942ec148135</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae3f71dc96c8942ec148135</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在清朗的正午时间写这一期的文案，此刻拨浪鼓有一位在收听，小拨浪鼓永远有人在任何时段默默支持着所以要来更新一下，正在度过缓慢的初秋预备期，还没有降温栾树已经过了最佳存活期，树木好像最先感知到季节的轮转且开始提前退场。上周去了一家新开的咖啡店喝了路边dirty但想用香芋维也纳做标题，不是手机扫码点单的形式就这样站在店内的前台和店主面对面开始手写点单环节，菜单上布满了星星波点元素还有一个start按键，可惜当时是赶路去到店里没有认真听店主的讲解现在把耐心留给收听这一期节目，整体是轻柔舒适的风格，有在好好听完这一期的朋友们感谢你们的停留，马上要开启11月需要给心腾出空间流入更多有益有趣的要素，一如往常松松软软地接住冷空气。</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhWOd1kZowgNw01OEW4UeWJl0MCc.jpg"></figure><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> No Time to Lose - Madison McFerrin</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> &nbsp;blue - girl in red</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> &nbsp;Elastic - Brandon</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a> Don't Wanna Let You Down - Lo Stone</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> Grandma Song - Rex Orange County</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> papa,son - 92914</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a> &nbsp; Just Anybody - Dylan Sinclair</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1537">25:37</a> &nbsp; folding chairs on the moon - grentperez/HONNE</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> &nbsp; A Seat For You (feat. Quinn Oulton) - Galdive/Quinn Oulton</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp; just keep driving - Keni Titus</span></p><p><span>加点冷空气再吃点沙拉</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlRRXM4-xjMD1Cb4-WQOQIBG15Kr.jpg"></figure><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
