  <item>
    <title>NO.45 回收坏心情端出没蒸熟的Jazzhiphop</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab1e09993d5eb3bdc79036b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab1e09993d5eb3bdc79036b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>九月的尾巴，一个被蛋黄酥、巴斯克麻薯月饼、柚子、超长蛋挞填满的夏末（以上有两种都没吃过）已经准备好迎接假期。最近经常在半夜醒来像是特定的流程，也做了好多个醒来想不起是什么剧情的梦，九月给了我离奇又丰富的夜晚。昨天刚收听完思文和王加一的</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab0c8c893d5eb3bdc789cad" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab0c8c893d5eb3bdc789cad"><span>夏日余味对谈节目</span></a><span>，听嘉宾提起因为看了一本书决定在福建旅居的过往，脑海里自动生成水气充斥暮色四合，人和景融在一起的画面，很适合睡前收听。回到本期的歌单，感谢HD909905S老师的留言投稿，提前祝大家接下来的假期顺利，2026剩下的时间希望我们都可以平静承接所有的失去和期待。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtG_w36nloSws6dNf_HsDkRP1wMx.jpg"><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> So Seductive - Kero One</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a> &nbsp;Never Let Go - 西原健一郎 (Kenichiro Nishihara)/Substantial</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> &nbsp;Pursuits of Clarity - DJ MITSU THE BEATS/Agape from Isosceles</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a> &nbsp; Say Somethin' - Soulchef/Nieve/Noah King/Adub/Tunji</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">15:22</a> &nbsp; Feelin' It - JAŸ-Z</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;The World Is Listening - Akua Naru</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> &nbsp; Hourglass - Gowe</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1564">26:04</a> You Too - Soulchef/Need Not Worry/Carla Waye</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1758">29:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;We Are All (ft. Semantic, Billy Kid) - LHA</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1947">32:27</a> Home (feat. Ine) - Nieve/Soulchef/Ine</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuk9v7g4wbvE3TO-UlYzP9OGQ_ZE.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
