  <item>
    <title>NO.44 尝试透明坦诚划过脆弱难料的夜晚</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6712b56356eb2d9be92330</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6712b56356eb2d9be92330</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 10:16:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>订阅拨浪鼓的朋友们好久不见，在七月底度过和小狗一起抗争病毒的一周，看着它再次安稳入睡的周天午后我也松懈下来，如常安稳的生活被打破在这过程里无数的细枝末节向内坍缩，原来我一直是一个容易被重视的一切牵动心绪，在夜里坐着流泪胡思乱想的脆弱的人。卸除掉不安焦虑烦躁，透明坦诚面对生活的突发状况，难料的夜晚需要轻松划过，放慢节奏一切损伤都会调理成健康状态，我们又一起闯过了一关，在路上留下一道长长的、盛满泥水的车胎印记。缓过神来整理出一期安抚自己的歌单，希望也能同样安抚到收听节目的大家，至少悬吊的心在这40分钟里能够放松下来。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FueLlIRptOPTcdWd_UGVWpu1FFla.jpg"><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> Anymore - Asha Banks/Novo Amor/Lowswimmer</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> &nbsp;Pillow - MoonD'shake</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> &nbsp;West Memphis - YEBBA</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> &nbsp; Multiplied - Luna Li</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> &nbsp;Through The Dark - The Sundays</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;if u want - Keni Titus</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> &nbsp; Winter Path - Dept (뎁트)</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> All Night - Kelsey Kuan</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1601">26:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp; frozen sandwich - 밀레나 (Milena)</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">29:05</a>&nbsp;&nbsp; Velvet Motion - modululu</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1934">32:14</a> Dusk - Alice Phoebe Lou</span></p><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2099">34:59</a> White Lightning - Ryan Beatty</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsHt-uRY_0txSNqsbkrP7Oq_5nHF.jpg"><p><span>小狗快快康复！</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
