  <item>
    <title>NO.43 游牧世界只想疯狂撒野</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69de570ce2c8be315536b7e6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69de570ce2c8be315536b7e6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 Apr 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时隔两个月来更新小拨浪鼓，四月是阴沉沉又闷热的主调，一到晚上就开始下雷阵雨，雨丝是悬在空中的钢琴弦，踮脚走过春末夏初却仍光秃秃的树，是的福建又加速进入蚊虫出没季节，讨厌这样的季节转换时刻。暗夜中手机蓝光里浮动的消息沉入地铁隧道，枯树新芽在落雨前悄悄进行新一轮的交换，那些没说破的絮语原来是保鲜膜裹紧的面包，每口都嚼出冰凉的絮状月光，游牧世界只想疯狂撒野，听一点律动的歌。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fot-Aaf5E2raYUTK7j8ygzsq7eCx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;4.14 雨声雷声</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a> &nbsp;keep you longer (Explicit) - Tyzo Bloom</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> &nbsp;Float - Wet</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> &nbsp;The Great Escape - Josie Edwards</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Wanna Run - Hojean</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cruel World - Holly Humberstone</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Every Once In A Blue Moon - a!ka</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Down the Road - EASHA</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Better - Alice Phoebe Lou</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1663">27:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Scared of the Dark - Em Beihold</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">30:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;cup of tea - Numcha</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj_dRJzyPsjTSz_zc2qqvLow2UFx.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
