    <guid isPermaLink="false">69889b2166e2c3037778690d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 10:17:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小拨浪鼓今年的第一次立即发布也是年前的最后一次，是只想放假不想写文案的一期，那就跟着节奏陷进我的双臂！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvw9jQi-GSh0bWw0vzQMnR4gZrUV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;想念 - Bell 傅熙雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> &nbsp;“HOMESWEETHOME” (윤석철 Remix) - 白艺潾</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="389">06:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Moon Eyes - Cehryl</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;no ties - Thuy</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="683">11:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;君のシルエット – Your Silhouette - LOFYO</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;On God! - Tiana Major9</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hey Homie (butter version) - Sofi Tukker/Silva</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Try to feel my pain - HAIM</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;There I Go - Lucy Park</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1508">25:08</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Closing the Door on Us - Dexter in the Newsagent/dexter/Kurisu</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1627">27:07</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Four A.M. (风在凌晨四点骤然刮起) - 幻觉抗体(Psychedelic Antibody）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgUBZtEmyK5krdopSs3NzUXaNt9O.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>提前祝大家新年快乐！</span></p>]]></description>
