  <item>
    <title>NO.37 穿堂风流向我灰蓝色的心门</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6862a75abef90978ecafdd7f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6862a75abef90978ecafdd7f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 15:05:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在六月的最后一天我再一次按下立即发布，在这个疲惫的周一深夜。周末和异地朋友见面的照片还没有整理，2025上一个半年告一段落。底色是阴晴不定是惴惴不安，每一个贪念都在下沉，需要动力去打捞实现。说不出有什么目标，永恒也从不是一句话就可以撑起的，第一首歌名翻译是名为时间的天使，悲伤的旋律比泪水先涌出的必须是决心，我想我应该需要一阵穿堂风，一阵流向灰蓝色心门的穿堂风。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lre1boL3GKAPNkOIqXCMs2OkW3pr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> ▏ 時間を名乗る天使 (ジカンヲナノルテンシ) - Cymbals (シンバルズ)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a> ▏ 心脏的右边 / Right Side of My Heart (feat. 魏如萱) - 鹤The Crane/魏如萱</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> ▏ &nbsp;dried flower - wave to earth</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> ▏ &nbsp;A Trick of the Light - Villagers</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a> ▏ &nbsp;Uncertainty - Melissa Polinar/Emily Elbert</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> ▏ &nbsp;What about Next Spring (feat. Kim Daniel of wave to earth) - 밀레나 (Milena)/김다니엘</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> ▏ &nbsp;They're In Love, Where Am I? - The Weepies/Deb Talan/Steve Tannen</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> ▏ &nbsp;&nbsp;窗 - 宇珩</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> ▏ &nbsp;Above Water - Melissa Polinar/Jeremy Passion</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a> ▏ &nbsp;Invisible One - 松倉サオリ</span></p><span></span><p><span>7月的幸福务必准时到来</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJAiabSo0aOI1eaYmzrOI8oN78-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
