ure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llPYBY0mOtrVOWcmvIoSjH7KWmSH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>夏日有抵不住的熱和濕 但也有無窮盡的光影</span></p>]]></description>
