    <title>NO.34 接收少量响指灵动信号</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f7c74f59699d74dce1baef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f7c74f59699d74dce1baef</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 11 Apr 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>四月又是嗜睡的季节，厚被子厚床单都还没换掉。本期更新韩语专场，响指声在歌曲间隙穿插忍不住跟着打响指数节拍，点燃空气里躁动的因子。升温的天气让皮肤黏腻，焦躁的心在胸腔里左冲右突，像困兽找不到出口，但没有关系明天就能去看徐佳莹了！响指声还在耳畔跳跃，心跳已经提前雀跃起来，焦灼会融化在旋律里！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvKVU-QXscOkfkhLiBsssOpNCS0r.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期响指集合：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ 더 나은 사람 - 김수영</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ &nbsp;산책 (Walk) - 모트 (Motte)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="479">07:59</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ &nbsp;꿈만 같은 일이야 - Kassy (케이시)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▏ &nbsp;&nbsp;TOUCH MY BODY - SAM KIM (샘김)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">14:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ 왜인지 모르게 (Feat. 새로, 진효정) &nbsp;- &nbsp;프롬유 (From.U)/새로 (Saero)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ &nbsp;serenade (Feat. 서은) - 프롬유 (From.U)/강서은</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▏ 널 좋아하나봐 - Acoustic Collabo (어쿠스틱 콜라보)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ Dreamin' love - Han All (한올)/Saevom (새봄)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ 연애의 시작 (The Beginning Of Us) - g0nny (거니)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ Wanna Love You - Paul Kim (폴킴)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">35:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ 너만 보여 (All I see is you) - Aalia (알리아)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkEuF1zkAFp7nKyB4JvwawtOvY3K.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
