  <item>
    <title>NO.33 JazzPlaylist 灵动捕手轻装上阵</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e2ca5baf5840b3334429c7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e2ca5baf5840b3334429c7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Mar 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天是小宇宙上线五周年的日子📆去年这个时候还没有穿上短袖，今年已经提前入夏。不过还是盖着冬天的床单即将在本周体验一年四季的温感。本期的封面是公园遛狗无意间看到的水管无滤镜情况下的金属感好酷，这期的爵士味道没有特别特别浓厚，选了一些轻盈柔和的歌闷热的天气需要轻装上阵！在走向春夏的路上不要有蚊虫的打扰（昨晚刚被咬）希望剩下还没开的郁金香可以顺利开花以及活力双马尾得皮肤病快快好～</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期歌单：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> &nbsp;▏ Altogether alone - BE THE VOICE (ビーザボイス)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏Sweet Georgia Brown - 紗理</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ Dream A Little Dream - Silje Nergaard</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ Feel Like Making Love (Bossa Version) - Marcela Mangabeira</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ Love Story - Marcela Mangabeira</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▏ THE MUSIC AROUND ME - 大橋トリオ (大桥三重唱)</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1263">21:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▏ Just My Type - Rosie Frater-Taylor</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ Just the Two of Us - 胡琳</span></p><span></span><p><span>▏ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1636">27:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;▏ &nbsp;September - 土岐麻子 (とき あさこ)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjcxAPfeRbkoHylBua13aTsKNgQa.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
